<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico seeks to inject 6.463 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico seeks to inject 6.463 bln pesos.</headline>
<text>
<p>MEXICO CITY, Sept 2 Reuter - The Banco de Mexico will seek to inject 6.463 billion pesos on Monday into the secondary money market through five credit auctions, traders said.</p>
<p>The auctions will be as follows:</p>
<p>	  CREDIT AUCTIONS   TERM</p>
<p>    1.488 bln pesos	8 days</p>
<p>    1.488 bln pesos	7 days</p>
<p>    1.487 bln pesos	3 days</p>
<p>    1.000 bln pesos	2 days</p>
<p>    1.000 bln pesos	1 day</p>
<p>-- Karina Balderas, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500</p>
</text>
